build.log
# Persistent on-Seal recipient used by scripts/bridge-e2e.sh
# (forward leg credits the wrapped balance; reverse leg signs the
# burn). Survives across runs so repeated `bridge-e2e.sh` calls
# don't burn a fresh address each time. Contains an ML-DSA secret
# key — must never enter version control.
.seal-e2e-key.json
# Captured anchor-test stdout from the Solana leg of bridge-e2e.sh —
# tee'd so the inline diag can grep the actual Lock tx hash on
# failure. Rewritten on every run; never useful in history.
.bridge-e2e-anchor-solana.log
